e="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2412737">ସ୍ଵୀକୃତ କରିବା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10179_143328_1881169"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A bar marked off in units of measure (such as inches) that is displayed across the top of the document window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="143328">horizontal ruler</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881169">ଭୂସମାନ୍ତର ରୁଲର</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1018_32207_1259813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To press and release a mouse button once without moving the mouse, usually to select or deselect an item or to activate a program or program feature.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="32207">click</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259813">କ୍ଲିକ୍ କରିବା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10180_131401_1260031"><langSet xml:la