 from the hard disk and remove related data from the registry so the software or solution is no longer available.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="125604">uninstall</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="484810">ଅପ୍ରତିଷ୍ଠା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10261_736801_484810"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">When referring to software, to remove program files and folders from the hard disk and remove related data from the registry so the software or solution is no longer available.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="736801">deinstall</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="484810">ଅପ୍ରତିଷ୍ଠା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10265_234076_1937083"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button that brings up an international list that allows users to block emails from those domains.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234076">Blocked Top-Level Domain List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1937083">ପ୍ରତିବନ୍ଧିତ ଶୀର୍ଷ ସ୍ତରୀୟ ଡୋମେନ୍ ସାରଣୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10268_169412_485071"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To do over again.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169412">redo</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485071">ପୁନଃକରଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10273_297181_485532"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A peer-to-peer file sharing client used to connect to file sharing networks in order to download or share files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="297181">file sharing program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485532">ଫାଇଲ୍ ଅଂଶୀଦାରୀ ପ୍ରୋଗ୍ରାମ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10275_6075_1259110"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of changing the values in cells to see how those changes affect the outcome of formulas on a worksheet. For example, varying the interest rate that is used in an amortization table to determine the amount of the payments.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="6075">what-if analysis</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259110">କଣ-ଯଦି ବିଶ୍ଳେଷଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10275_6076_1259110"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of changing the values in cells to see how those changes affect the outcome of formulas on a worksheet. For example, varying the interest rate that is used in an amortization table to determine the amount of the payments.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="6076">"what-if" evaluation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259110">କଣ-ଯଦି ବିଶ୍ଳେଷଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10276_232855_485241"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that displays the Web page in a Web browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232855">Web Page Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485241">ଓ୍ବେବ୍ ପେଜ୍ ପୂର୍ବାଲୋକନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></