d</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11264_233734_1881295"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of files that can be delivered as a unit to a client computer or device for installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233734">deployment package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881295">ଡିପ୍ଲଏମେଣ୍ଟ୍ ପ୍ୟାକେଜ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11268_2461481_1816588"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Control Panel feature that is used to set restrictions on what traffic is allowed to enter your network from the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2461481">Windows Defender Firewall</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1816588">Windows Firewall</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11268_2461481_2466722"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Control Panel feature that is used to set restrictions on what traffic is allowed to enter your network from the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2461481">Windows Defender Firewall</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig>