ular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15047_318786_485739"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ≤ character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318786">LESS-THAN OR EQUAL TO</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485739">ଏହାଠାରୁ କ୍ଷୁଦ୍ରତର ବା ସମାନ ଚିହ୍ନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15047_318787_485739"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ≤ character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318787">less than or equal to sign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485739">ଏହାଠାରୁ କ୍ଷୁଦ୍ରତର ବା ସମାନ ଚିହ୍ନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15049_263066_485426"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A client software component that declares a client's health state (by providing a statement of health) to a NAP agent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="263066">system health agent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485426">ପ୍ରଣାଳୀ ସ୍ବାସ୍ଥ୍ଯ ପ୍ରତିନିଧି</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><