n</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1426198">ଫର୍ମ ଅଞ୍ଚଳ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16465_588928_1881351"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A bar chart subtype that compares values across categories.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="588928">clustered bar chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881351">କ୍ଳଷ୍ଟର୍‌ଯୁକ୍ତ ଦଣ୍ଡିକା ଚାର୍ଟ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16466_588929_1881352"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pie chart with user-defined values extracted and combined into a second pie.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="588929">pie of pie chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881352">ପାଇ ଚାର୍ଟ୍‌ର ପାଇ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16467_588930_1881353"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pie chart with user-defined values extracted and combined into a stacked bar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="588930">bar of pie chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881353">ପାଇ ଚାର୍ଟ୍‌ର ଦଣ୍ଡିକା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16468_1485421_1881354"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pie chart that displays the contribution of each value to a total while emphasizing individual values, by showing each slice of the pie as "pulled out," or separate, from the whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1485421">exploded pie</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881354">ଏକ୍ସପ୍ଲୋଡେଡ୍ ପାଇ ଚାର୍ଟ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16468_588931_1881354"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pie chart that displays the contribution of each value to a total while emphasizing individual values, by showing each slice of the pie as "pulled out," or separate, from the whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="588931">exploded pie chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881354">ଏକ୍ସପ୍ଲୋଡେଡ୍ ପାଇ ଚାର୍ଟ୍</te