e necessary components are installed on a system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="80862">minimum installation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="484559">ନ୍ଯୁନତମ ସ୍ଥାପନକରଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20653_730882_1779685"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A folder that stores the user's graphics, e.g. digital pictures. Many graphic design and photo-editing programs use this location by default to open or save graphic files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="730882">Pictures</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1779685">ଛବିସମୂହ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20655_732027_1259238"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that replaces the File menu beginning with some 2007 Microsoft Office system programs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="732027">Microsoft Office Button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259238">ଅଫିସ୍ ବଟନ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20655_732027_1881431"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that replaces the File menu beginning with some 2007 Microsoft Office system programs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="732027">Microsoft Office Button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881431">Microsoft Office Button</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20655_747784_1259238"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that replaces the File menu beginning with some 2007 Microsoft Office system programs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747784">Office Button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259238">ଅଫିସ୍ ବଟନ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20655_747784_1881431"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that replaces the File menu beginning with some 2007 Microsoft Office system programs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747784">Office Button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881431">Microsoft Office Button</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20673_741964_1957687"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mailbox that represents conference rooms and company equipment. Resource mailboxes can be included as resources in meeting requests, providing a simple and efficient way to utilize resources for an organization. The user account that is associated with a resource mailbox is disabled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="741964">resource mailbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1957687">ଉତ୍ସ ମେଲବାକ୍ସ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20675_743746_1519893"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To monitor an email conversation or newsgroup thread. The headers for messages in a watched conversation appear in a different color, which makes them easier to find in a message list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="743746">watch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1519893">ପର୍ଯ୍ୟବେକ୍ଷଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20683_745706_1259239"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option on the Views menu in File Explorer that shows the most appropriate details for the file type in a flexible layout rather than only showing the details associated with the column headers in the view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="745706">Content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259239">ସୂଚୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20689_2356132_2359899"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Control Panel that provides the user with a single point of entry for tasks and notifications related to security and general PC software maintenance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2356132">Security and Maintenance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359899">ସୁରକ୍ଷା ଏବଂ ମରାମତି</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20695_746372_1259241"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A gallery that allows users to create a quick rule to move mail to a selected folder based on the sender, recipients, or conversation of the currently selected email message without opening the full Create Rule dialog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="746372">Always Move gallery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259241">ସର୍ବଦା ଗତିଶୀଳ ଗ୍ୟାଲେରୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20697_777440_1259242"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of computers on a home network that can share pictures, music, videos, documents, and printers. A homegroup is created by using the HomeGroup feature; it is protected with a password.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777440">homegroup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259242">ମୂଳଗୋଷ୍ଠୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20698_782774_1259243"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A password that helps prevent unauthorized access to homegroup files and printers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="782774">homegroup password</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259243">ମୂଳଗୋଷ୍ଠୀ ପାସଓ୍ୱାର୍ଡ଼୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20702_746417_1259244"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A digital or paper format pack that usually consists of a proof of purchase, the description of the licensing terms and policies, and number of client access licenses (CALs) purchased in this pack.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="746417">CAL pack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259244">CAL ପ୍ୟାକ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20703_746420_1259245"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action that removes redundant messages from an email conversation to reduce information overload and improve readability.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="746420">Clean Up</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259245">ପରିଷ୍କାର କରିବା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20704_746421_1259246"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A fork within a conversation, where more than one reply was made to a single email and caused a split in the conversation.<