he value of a property or attribute.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30138">change</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259003">ପରିବର୍ତ୍ତନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20839_747785_1259253"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that provides access to gallery of frequently-used actions with the touch of a button. Users can customize the gallery to execute a combination of operations in one click.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747785">Quick Steps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259253">ଦ୍ରୁତ ଷ୍ଟେପସ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20840_747989_1426235"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A frame that contains text, shapes, pictures, or other content. A slide is a digital equivalent to a traditional film slide.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747989">slide</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1426235">ସ୍ଲାଇଡ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20843_748066_2497559"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows tool used to capture a screen shot, or snip, of any object on the screen, and then annotate, save, or share the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="748066">Snipping Tool</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497559">ସ୍ନିପିଂ ଟୁଲ୍‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20848_748169_1937101"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To mark an email conversation so that all current and future messages in the conversation are automatically moved to the Deleted Items folder.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="748169">ignore</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1937101">ଉପେକ୍ଷା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20849_748170_1259255"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A special control that shows pictures, names and titles of people who are attending a meeting, or who are the recipients of an email message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="748170">Attendee/Recipient List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259255">ଉପସ୍ଥିତ ବ୍ୟକ୍ତି/ଗ୍ରହିତା ତାଲିକା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20851_1140414_2816309"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of people who can answer calls on behalf of someone else.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1140414">team-call group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816309">ଦଳ-କଲ୍ ଗୋଷ୍ଠୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20852_748234_2953959"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A call to a call group that rings the group owner and call group simultaneously. When a member of the group answers the call, the other members get a notification with the status of the call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="748234">group call</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2953959">ଗୋଷ୍ଠୀ କଲ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20854_748237_1881433"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user's work day hours as specified in Microsoft Office Outlook by the day of the week and the start and end times.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="748237">working hours</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881433">କାର୍ଯ୍ୟ ସମୟ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20855_748246_2926656"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To create an indication that the user has an incoming call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="748246">ring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926656">ରିଂ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20857_1172884_1881551"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An auto-reply text specified using Outlook's Automatic Replies or Out of Office Assistant.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1172884">automatic reply</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881551">ସ୍ଵତଃସ୍ପୃତ ପ୍ରତ୍ୟୁତ୍ତର</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender"