s a trademark, but not a registered trademark.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319160">TRADE MARK SIGN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485753">ଟ୍ରେଡ଼ମାର୍କ ସଙ୍କେତ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21197_767142_1259296"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that replicates the animation associated with a source object to one or more target objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767142">Animation Painter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259296">ଆନିମେସନ୍ ପେଣ୍ଟର୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21199_767144_1259297"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An abstract grouping of similar animation effects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767144">animation style</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259297">ଆନିମେସନ୍ ଶୈଳୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21200_767145_1259298"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An effect that a user can apply to an image to achieve a specific artistic look.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767145">artistic effect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259298">କଳାତ୍ମକ ପ୍ରଭାବ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21201_767146_1259299"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual representation of an audio signal over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767146">audio waveform</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259299">ଅଡ଼ିଓ ଓ୍ୱେଭଫର୍ମ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21202_767148_1259300"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image editing feature that allows a user to isolate the foreground portion of an image and make the background transparent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767148">Background Removal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259300">ପୃଷ୍ଟପଟ୍ଟ କାଢିବା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21203_767149_1937085"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that removes narrations and laser pointer gestures or timings from a presentation or from a specific slide.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767149">Clear Recordings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1937085">ରେକର୍ଡ଼ିଂ ଗୁଡିକ ଖାଲି କରନ୍ତୁ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2121_375_483918"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An area of memory reserved for temporarily holding data before that data is used by a receiving device or application. Buffering protects against the interruption of data flow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="375">buffer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="483918">ବଫର୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21211_767324_1881438"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of cryptographic algorithms specified by the US National Security Agency to provide an interoperable standard for government and industry.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767324">Suite B</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881438">ସୁଟ୍ B</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21212_767327_1259302"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability of software to support customer-preferred algorithms for encryption, hashing, entropy and digital signatures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767327">cryptographic agility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259302">କ୍ରିପ୍ଟୋଗ୍ରାଫିକ୍ ଆଜିଲିଟି</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21212_767327_1259303"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability of software to support customer-preferred algorithms for encryption, hashing, entropy and digital signatures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767327">cryptographic agility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259303">କ୍ରିପ୍ଟୋ ଆଜିଲିଟି</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21212_767328_1259302"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability of software to support customer-preferred algorithms for encryption, hashing, entropy and digital signatures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767328">crypto agility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259302">କ୍ରିପ୍ଟୋଗ୍ରାଫିକ୍ ଆଜିଲିଟି</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21212_767328_1259303"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability of software to support customer-preferred algorithms for encryption, hashing, entropy and digital signatures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767328">crypto agility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259303">କ୍ରିପ୍ଟୋ ଆଜିଲିଟି</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21213_767329_1802573"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The portion of InfoPath used to design forms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767329">Designer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1802573">ଡିଜାଇନର୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21217_767333_1426236"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove a user's changes from the Microsoft Office Document Cache without deleting the file on the server or removing the latest version downloaded from the server from the Office Document Cache.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767333">discard changes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1426236">ପରିବର୍ତ୍ତନ ପରିତ୍ୟାଗ କରନ୍ତୁ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21227_767357_1259304"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security feature that validates files before allowing them to be loaded by the application, in order to protect against file format vulnerabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767357">Office File Validation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259304">ଅଫିସ୍ ଫାଇଲ୍ ବୈଧିକରଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21244_767583_1937097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows end users and IT admins to control which file types and versions can be opened and saved in the application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767583">File Block</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1937097">ଫାଇଲ୍ ସମୁଦାୟ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21253_767590_1259306"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to superimpose a dot over a presentation and control its position with the mouse. The appearance of the dot is similar to that of a traditional laser pointer, and it is broadcast to all presentation viewers and can be recorded into video (Save to Video).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767590">Laser Pointer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259306">ଲେଜର୍ ପଏଣ୍ଟର</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21265_767631_1259307"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that initiates an email response addressed to all of the recipients on the To or Cc lines of the original message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767631">Reply to All</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="