l response addressed to all of the recipients on the To or Cc lines of the original message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767632">Reply All</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259308">ପ୍ରତିଉତ୍ତର ସମସ୍ତ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21277_768421_1259309"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The mode of Windows Photo Viewer which consists of a top level window displaying one photograph at a time, with navigation controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="768421">Photo Viewer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259309">ଫଟୋ ଦର୍ଶନକାରୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21278_768422_1259310"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode of Windows Photo Viewer which displays full-screen slide shows for photos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="768422">Slideshow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259310">ସ୍ଲାଇଡ଼ସୋ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="gramma