ular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26508_1275542_1957411"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of logging available to capture information about mailbox searches that includes information about the search and who performed it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275542">basic logging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1957411">ମୌଳିକ ଲଗିଂ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26509_1275544_1957528"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of logging available to capture information about mailbox searches that includes information about all results that meet the search criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275544">full logging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1957528">ପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ ଲଗିଂ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26510_1275547_1957414"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A window that serves as an interface between the user and the browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275547">browser window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term