andards-based APIs and the downloadable Live SDK.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1586827">Live Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1663334">Live Connect</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31003_1586834_1639737"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A nonfinal release of Windows that's made available to developers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1586834">Windows Developer Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1639737">Windows ଡେଭଲପର୍ ପୂର୍ବାବଲୋକନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31008_1587432_1680116"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statement indicating that the copyright holder reserves, or holds for their own use, all the rights provided by copyright law, such as distribution, performance, and creation of derivative works; that is, they have not waived any such right.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1587432">All rights reserved.</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1680116">ସର୍ବସତ୍ତ୍ଵ ସଂରକ୍ଷିତ ৷</term><termNote type="geog