omment when clicked.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623958">comment hint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881672">ମନ୍ତବ୍ୟ ସଙ୍କେତ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31789_1623959_1881673"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pane beside the document that displays all comments made in the document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623959">Comments pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881673">ମନ୍ତବ୍ୟସମୂହ ଫଳକ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31790_1623960_1881674"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A crawl that operates on a continuous basis to scan and index new and modified content from a source.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623960">continuous crawl</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881674">ଲଗାତାର ଟାଣନ୍ତୁ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry