nd storing that information as additional managed properties for the item.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653510">property extraction</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881802">ଏଣ୍ଟିଟି ବାହ୍ୟକରଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32336_1653514_1881803"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A content processing or query processing pipeline that contains operators that determine how the content or the query is processed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653514">flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881803">ଫ୍ଲୋ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32337_1653516_1881804"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A copy of a search index within an index partition.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653516">index replica</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881804">ଇଣ୍ଡେକ୍ସ୍ ନକଲ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32338_1653517_1881805"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object that processes and enhances items in a content processing flow and processes and enhances queries in a query processing flow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653517">operator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881805">ଅପରେଟର୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32339_1653518_1881806"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An XML document that describes how to rank items in search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653518">ranking model</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881806">ରେଙ୍କିଂ ମୋଡେଲ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32340_1653519_1881807"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process that ensures that index replicas on the same index partition remain synchronized during regular operation and during recovery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653519">seeding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881807">ସିଡିଂ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32341_1653521_1881808"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of managed properties that are updated together in the search index.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653521">update group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881808">ଅଦ୍ୟତନ ଗୋଷ୍ଠୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32342_1653526_1881809"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be queried against. The query must contain the managed property field name, either in the query itself or programmatically.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653526">queryable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881809">ଜିଜ୍ଞାସୁ ପରିଚାଳିତ ଗୁଣଧର୍ମ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32343_1653528_1881810"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be used as the basis for a refiner for search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653528">refinable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881810">ପୁନଃସ୍ଵଚ୍ଚଯୋଗ୍ୟ ପରିଚାଳିତ ଗୁଣଧର୍ମ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32344_1653529_1881811"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be displayed in search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653529">retrievable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881811">ପୁନଃଉଦ୍ଧାରଯୋଗ୍ୟ ପରିଚାଳିତ ଗୁଣଧର୍ମ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32345_1653531_1881812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property whose value can be returned by a query.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653531">searchable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881812">ସନ୍ଧାନଯୋଗ୍ୟ ପରିଚାଳିତ ଗୁଣଧର୍ମ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32346_1653533_1881813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property whose result set can be sorted based on the property before the result set is returned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653533">sortable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881813">ସର୍ଟ‌ଯୋଗ୍ୟ ପରିଚାଳିତ ଗୁଣଧର୍ମ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32350_1656127_1881814"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user defined dictionary that lists single words or phrases that the system matches to words in the content in either a case-sensitive way or a case-insensitive way, depending on the type of dictionary that is used.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656127">custom extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881814">କଷ୍ଟମ୍ ବାହ୍ୟକରଣ ଅଭିଧାନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32351_1656134_1881815"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched to exact words in the content in a case-sensitive way. For example, the system matches "anchor" to "anchor," but not to "Anchor" or "Anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656134">exact word extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881815">ଯଥାର୍ଥ ଶବ୍ଦ ନିଷ୍କର୍ଷଣ ଅଭିଧାନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32352_1656137_1881816"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched anywhere in the content in a case-sensitive way. For example, the system matches "anchor" and "anchorage," but not "Anchor."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656137">exact word part extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881816">ଯଥାର୍ଥ ଶବ୍ଦାଂଶ ନିଷ୍କର୍ଷଣ ଅଭିଧାନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32353_1656140_1881817"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched to exact words in the content in a case-insensitive way. For example, the entry "anchor" will match "anchor" and "Anchor," but not "anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656140">word extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881817">word ବାହ୍ୟକରଣ ଅଭିଧାନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32354_1656141_1881818"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched anywhere in the content in a case-insensitive way. For example, the entry "anchor" will match "anchor," "Anchor," and "anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656141">word part extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881818">ଶବ୍ଦାଂଶ ବାହ୍ୟକରଣ ଅଭିଧାନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32355_1656142_1881819"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A data structure that describes crawled properties, managed properties, and the mapping between them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656142">search schema</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881819">ସନ୍ଧାନ ସ୍କିମା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32356_1656144_1881820"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A logical portion of the search index.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656144">index partition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881820">ଇଣ୍ଡେକ୍ସ୍ ଭାଗକରଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32359_1657886_1663380"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of apps that includes Messenger, Photo Gallery, Movie Maker, OneDrive, Mail, Writer, and Family Safety. (Family Safety is only included in Windows 7 downloads; it's built in to Windows 8.)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1657886">Windows Essentials 2012</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1663380">Windows ଏସେନ୍‌ସିଆଲ୍ 2012</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32362_1658249_1881822"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode in which SharePoint Server is the primary source for all the project details. Project Server scheduling, time and status, and advanced functionality are disabled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1658249">visibility mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881822">ଦୃଶ୍ୟଲବ୍ଧତା ମୋଡ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32367_1666384_1685097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature that enables users to connect computers with a simple tap gesture or by browsing for computers within wireless range. If two computers come within 3-4 centimeters of each other, or are tapped together, the operating system of each computer becomes aware of the other computer. Also, a user can browse for computers within wireless range that are advertising for a peer connection. The user can then connect the two computers to share content such as photos or links, or create a multi-player experience. If the connection is made using a tap gesture, the user can also publish and subscribe to messages transmitted during the tap.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1666384">proximity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1685097">ନିକଟତା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_1513455_1639449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1513455">intermediate CA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1639449">ମଧ୍ୟସ୍ଥ CA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_1513455_1639450"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1513455">intermediate CA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1639450">ମଧ୍ୟସ୍ଥ ସାର୍ଟିଫିକେସନ୍ ଅଧିକାରୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_68764_1639449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="68764">intermediate certification authority</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1639449">ମଧ୍ୟସ୍ଥ CA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_68764_1639450"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="68764">intermediate certification authority</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1639450">ମଧ୍ୟସ୍ଥ ସାର୍ଟିଫିକେସନ୍ ଅଧିକାରୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32395_1667479_1676010"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of Windows where a user's credentials are securely stored.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1667479">Credential Locker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676010">କ୍ରେଡେନ୍‌ସିଆଲ୍ ଲକର୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32397_1667525_1678210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To take action on a message by either replying to the sender, to the sender and all recipients, or by forwarding the message to someone else.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1667525">respond</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678210">ପ୍ରତିକ୍ରିୟା କରିବା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote ty