ted</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340251">ୱଉନ୍ଡେର୍ଲିଷ୍ଟ ସାହାର୍ଯ୍ୟକାରୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40123_2331939_2340247"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Wunderlist feature that allows users to enter due dates for a task as text (e.g. next Sunday), automatically recognize the date, and set a due date and reminder for the task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331939">Smart Due Dates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340247">ସ୍ମାର୍ଟ ଧାର୍ଯ୍ୟ ତାରିଖ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40124_2332081_2340246"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that gives users information regarding the safety of a message via a colored bar inserted into the message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332081">Safety Tips</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340246">ସୁରକ୍ଷା ଟିପ୍ପଣୀଗୁଡିକ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40126_2332083_2340245"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows administrators to inform email senders that they may be about to violate one of the data loss prevention policies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332083">Policy Tips</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340245">ପଲିସୀ ଟିପ୍ପଣୀଗୁଡିକ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40162_2333642_2340243"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A UI element that gives a user a view of the important email, as presorted by the Focused Inbox feature.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333642">Focused</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340243">କେନ୍ଦ୍ରିକ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40163_2333645_2340244"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The email management approach developed by productivity expert Merlin Mann so that zero time is spent thinking about email without any of the five actions he identified.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333645">Inbox Zero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:l