mmaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4097_87181_484603"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technology that uses multidimensional structures to provide rapid access to data for analysis. The source data for OLAP is commonly stored in data warehouses in a relational database.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="87181">OLAP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="484603">OLAP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4097_87182_1413130"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technology that uses multidimensional structures to provide rapid access to data for analysis. The source data for OLAP is commonly stored in data warehouses in a relational database.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="87182">online analytical processing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1413130">ଅନଲାଇନ୍ ବିଶ୍ଲେଷଣାତ୍ମକ ପ୍ରକ୍ରିୟାକରଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4097_87182_484603"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technology that uses multidimensional structures to provide rapid access to data for analysis. The source data for OLAP is commonly stored in data warehouses in a relational d