t professional to help solve a problem with your PC by accessing and taking control of it over a remote connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3160521">Microsoft Quick Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2373873">ଶୀଘ୍ର ସହାୟତା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41921_3160521_3161111"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app included in Windows that allows a trusted friend or support professional to help solve a problem with your PC by accessing and taking control of it over a remote connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3160521">Microsoft Quick Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161111">Microsoft କୁଇକ୍ ଆସିଷ୍ଟ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41931_2374260_2377966"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that allows users to create a pictorial table of contents containing a collection of their Section Zooms and that can update if the presentation is edited.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374260">Summary Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377966">ସାରାଂଶ ଜୁମ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41932_2374261_2377965"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that presents a preview of a slide in a presentation which auto-updates when the slide is updated and navigates users to that slide when they click on the preview</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374261">Slide Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377965">ସ୍ଲାଇଡ୍ ଜୁମ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41933_2374264_2377964"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that presents a preview of a section in a presentation which auto-updates when the section’s first slide is updated, navigates users to that section when they click on the preview, and returns them back to the Summary Zoom when they are done.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374264">Section Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377964">ବିଭାଗ ଜୁମ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41938_2374322_2513564"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that teachers can use to provision student PCs for classroom use.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374322">Set up School PCs</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513564">ସ୍କୁଲ PCs ସେଟ ଅପ୍‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41939_2374323_2513566"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The education app used for secure, online assessments, such as exams. It doesn't allow test takers to access resources stored on their device or the internet; it prevents OS-level distractions; and it doesn't allow test-takers to share test content with other students.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374323">Take a Test</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513566">ଏକ ପରୀକ୍ଷା ନିଅନ୍ତୁ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41946_2375030_2378309"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for games that are rented most over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375030">Most rented games</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378309">ସର୍ବାଧିକ ଭଡାଯୁକ୍ତ ଗେମ୍‌ସମୂହ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41947_2375031_2378308"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for apps that are rented most over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375031">Most rented apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378308">ସର୍ବାଧିକ ଭଡାଯୁକ୍ତ ଆପ୍ଲିକେସନ୍‌ସମୂହ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41948_2375032_2378307"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for apps or games that are rented most over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375032">Most rented</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378307">ସର୍ବାଧିକ ଭଡାଯୁକ୍ତ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41949_2375033_2378302"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for game