eam by sharing their expertise with the community in activities such as listening and responding to customer feedback, contributing to community forums, blogging about tips and tricks, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375041">community champion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378312">ସମ୍ପ୍ରଦାୟ ଚମ୍ପିୟନ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41957_2751151_2378312"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person who informally represents their feature team by sharing their expertise with the community in activities such as listening and responding to customer feedback, contributing to community forums, blogging about tips and tricks, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2751151">community champ</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378312">ସମ୍ପ୍ରଦାୟ ଚମ୍ପିୟନ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4196_213534_485183"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The number of colors or levels of gray that can be displayed at one time. The amount or memory in the computer's graphics controller card controls the display. An 8-bit controller can display 256 colors or levels of gray; a 16-bit controller, 64,000 colors; and a 24-bit controller, 16.8 million colors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="213534">bit specification</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485183">ବିଟ୍ ସୁନିର୍ଦ୍ଧିଷ୍ଟକରଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41961_2375458_3113262"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The basic amount of the guaranteed ingress/egress of events sent to an Event Hub that can be dynamically scaled according to stream processing, to pay only for compute needs and handle jobs with gigabytes/sec of streamed data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375458">capacity unit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113262">କ୍ଷମତା ୟୁନିଟ୍‌</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41961_2766779_3113262"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The basic amount of the guaranteed ingress/egress of events sent to an Event Hub that can be dynamically scaled according to stream processing, to pay only for compute needs and handle jobs with gigabytes/sec of streamed data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2766779">CU</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113262">କ୍ଷମତା ୟୁନିଟ୍‌<