ains app install rule, SmartScreen settings, and exploit protection settings.​​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2451801">App &amp; browser control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453330">ଆପ୍ଲିକେସନ୍ ଏବଂ ବ୍ରାଉଜର୍ ନିୟନ୍ତ୍ରଣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43294_2451802_2453331"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area of the Windows Defender app that contains information and actions related to performance and PC health.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2451802">Computer performance &amp; health</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453331">କମ୍ପ୍ୟୁଟର୍ ପ୍ରଦର୍ଶନ ଏବଂ ହେଲ୍ଥ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43295_2451803_2453332"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area of the Windows Defender app for ​family features, linking o the Family tab of the Microsoft account portal.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2451803">Family options</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453332">ପରିବାର ବିକଳ୍ପସମୂହ</term><termNote type="geographica