tal resolution of 3840 (or 4096) pixels and vertical resolution of 2160 pixels. Several 4K resolutions exist in the fields of digital television and digital cinematography.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2505315">4K</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2577515">4K</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44537_2505358_2506015"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office Dictate button that allows users to override the Automatic Punctuation mode so that they can use voice commands (such as comma and period) to create punctuation in their document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2505358">Manual Punctuation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2506015">Manual Punctuation</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44546_2506467_2513561"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A record of all purchases made by a user from an online store or portal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2506467">order history</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513561">ଅର୍ଡର ଇତିବୃତି</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44569_2506611_2513567"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technology that enables Wi-Fi devices to connect directly, without a router or other mechanism, making it simpler to do things like print, share, sync, and display.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2506611">Wi-Fi Direct</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513567">Wi-Fi Direct</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44586_2506886_2513558"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An app that enables members of a Language community to provide translation and language-related feedback about features. The app is currently available only for Windows Desktop.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2506886">Language Community app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513558">ଭାଷା ସମ୍ପ୍ରଦାୟ ଆପ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44587_2506888_2513559"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A request to gather and send language feedback using quests in Feedback Hub and the Language Community app.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2506888">language quest</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513559">ଭାଷା ଅନୁସନ୍ଧାନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4459_148656_484986"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The slide that stores information about the design template applied, including font styles, placeholder sizes and positions, background design, and color schemes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148656">slide master</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="484986">ସ୍ଲାଇଡ୍ ମାଷ୍ଟର୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44608_2573054_2577519"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section of the expanded view of the profile card that contains LinkedIn profile information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2573054">LinkedIn profile in Microsoft</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2577519">Microsoft ରେ LinkedIn ପ୍ରୋଫାଇଲ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44611_2509173_2513420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to compose and save a message as a template, and then reuse it when they want to.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2509173">Email templates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513420">ଇମେଲ୍ ଟେମ୍ପଲେଟ୍‌ଗୁଡିକ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4462_72367_484483"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The core of layered architecture that manages the most basic operations of the operating system and the computer's processor. The kernel schedules different blocks of executing code, called threads, for the processor to keep it as busy as possible and coordinates multiple processors to optimize performance. The kernel also synchronizes activities among Executive-level subcomponents, such as I/O Manager and Process Manager, and handles hardware exceptions and other hardware-dependent functions. The kernel works closely with the hardware abstraction layer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="72367">kernel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="484483">କେନ୍ଦ୍ରିକ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44646_2897501_3088319"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cloud service that helps protect your enterprise hybrid environments from multiple types of advanced targeted cyber attacks and insider threats.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2897501">Microsoft Defender for Identity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3088319">ପରିଚୟ ପାଇଁ Microsoft Defender</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44647_2513424_2517609"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To take an existing story in the Photos app and generate a new version of that story with edits to content, style, music, and other options.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513424">remix</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2517609">ରିମିକ୍ସ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44648_2513444_2517610"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Groove Music app, a graphical display that changes colors and shapes on the screen in response to the music that is playing. The user can choose from several different visualizers, which each look different.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513444">visualizer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2517610">ଭିଜୁଆଲାଇଜର୍‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44668_2515502_2517604"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The setting (toggle) on account.microsoft.com/family that, when switched on, requires children to get adult permission for the things they buy in the Windows and Xbox stores — except for what they get with gift cards or money in their Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2515502">Ask a parent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2517604">ଜଣେ ଅଭିଭାବକଙ୍କୁ ପଚାରନ୍ତୁ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44669_2515503_2517605"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The capability of Microsoft Defender Advanced Threat Protection, which helps protect the data in the specified folder locations from modification by suspicious or malicious apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2515503">controlled folder access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2517605">ନିୟନ୍ତ୍ରିତ ଫୋଲ୍ଡର୍‍ ପ୍ରବେଶ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44670_2515507_2517606"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Groove Music that allows the sound in specified frequency bands to be amplified or reduced, in order to adjust the quality and character of the sound.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2515507">equalizer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2517606">ଇକ୍ଵାଲାଇଜର୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44671_2515527_2568348"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of people who uses or shares a common language or dialect and contributes to language-related activities for Windows features.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2515527">Language Community</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2568348">ଭାଷା ସମ୍ପ୍ରଦାୟ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44672_2515529_2568349"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A section in the Feedback Hub app where users can organize language-related activities for their Language community.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2515529">Language Community tab</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2568349">ଭାଷା ସମ୍ପ୍ରଦାୟ ଟ୍ୟାବ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44676_2515692_2517794"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that generates Office 365 reports using SharePoint on-premises diagnostic and usage logs so that administrators can manage their infrastructure more efficiently.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2515692">SharePoint Insights</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2517794">SharePoint Insights</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="447_51731_484363"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that lists errors that were encountered during an operation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="51731">error log</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="484363">ତ୍ରୁଟି ଲଗ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><