Selected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521258">କ୍ରିୟାଯୋଗ୍ୟ ବାର୍ତ୍ତା କାର୍ଡ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44755_2520242_2521257"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows users to create and interact with actionable message cards.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520242">Actionable Messages</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521257">କ୍ରିୟାଯୋଗ୍ୟ ବାର୍ତ୍ତାସମୂହ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44765_2520274_3115272"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables customers to control access to rows in a database table based on the characteristics of the user executing a query (e.g., group membership or execution context).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520274">Row Level Security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115272">ରୋ-ଲେଭେଲ୍ ସୁରକ୍ଷା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44765_2520275_3115272"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables customers to control access to rows in a database table based on the characteristics of the user executing a query (e.g., group membership or execution context).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520275">RLS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115272">ରୋ-ଲେଭେଲ୍ ସୁରକ୍ଷା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44765_3114827_3115272"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables customers to control access to rows in a database table based on the characteristics of the user executing a query (e.g., group membership or execution context).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114827">row-level security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115272">ରୋ-ଲେଭେଲ୍ ସୁରକ୍ଷା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44776_2520537_2522038"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A message that contains an actionable message card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520537">actionable message</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lan