Note><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50237_2842097_2995967"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A formula for finding any power of a binomial without multiplying at length. According to the theorem, it is possible to expand the polynomial (x + y)n into a polynomial sum expression.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842097">binomial theorem</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2995967">ବାଇନୋମିଆଲ୍ ଥିଓରମ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50238_2842098_2843336"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A function that automatically changes passwords after a certain time interval.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842098">password rotation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843336">ପାସ୍‌ୱାର୍ଡ ପୁନରାବର୍ତ୍ତନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50240_2842100_2843340"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A PowerPoint feature that allows the user to enter rehearsal mode and while speaking receive on-screen guidance about pacing, inclusive language, use of filler words, and culturally insensitive phrases. At the end of each rehearsal session, a detailed report with metrics for additional practice is provided.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842100">Presenter Coach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843340">ପ୍ରେଜେଣ୍ଟର୍ କୋଚ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50241_2842101_2843328"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An optional feature of Skype for Business Server that allows meeting attendees to join the audio portion of a meeting by calling in to the meeting from a phone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842101">dial-in conferencing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843328">ଡାଏଲ୍-ଇନ୍ କନଫରେନ୍ସିଂ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50294_2844119_3042781"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One of the primary additive colors for transmitted light, the color of blood, ripe strawberries, etc.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844119">red</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3042781">ଲାଲ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammat