y celebrated on September 28 to commemorate the day in 935 on which St. Wenceslas, patron of the Czech state, was murdered by his brother.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891233">Czech Statehood Day (St. Wenceslas Day)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891472">ସିଜଏଚ୍ ରାଜ୍ୟ ଦିବସ (ସେଣ୍ଟ. ୱେଲନେସ୍ ଡେ)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51304_2891239_2891476"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Argentinian national holiday celebrated on June 20 to commemorate the Argentine flag and its creator, Manuel Belgrano.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891239">Flag Day</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891476">ପତାକା ଦିବସ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51305_2891254_2891481"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The supplementary holiday day that may be granted during years in which Argentina's Flag Day occurs on a Tuesday or a Thursday and is used to create a four-day weekend.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891254">Flag Day (bridge)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891481">ପତାକା ଦିବସ (ବ୍ରିଜ୍)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51306_2891255_2891478"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Mexican national holiday celebrated on February 24 to commemorate past and current flags of Mexico.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891255">Flag Day</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891478">ପତାକା ଦିବସ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51307_2891256_2891479"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The national holiday in Poland celebrated on May 2 to commemorate the raising of the Polish flag over the Victory Column at the end of the Battle of Berlin in 1945.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891256">Flag Day</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891479">ପତାକା ଦିବସ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51308_2891257_2891483"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Azerbaijan national holiday celebrated on November 9 to commemorate the adoption of the Flag of Azerbaijan on November 9, 1918.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891257">National Flag Day</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891483">ଜାତୀୟ ପତାକା ଦିବସ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51309_2891258_2891485"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The day on which the Azerbaijan National Flag Day is celebrated if the official holiday itself falls on a weekend.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891258">National Flag Day (Observed)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891485">ଜାତୀୟ ପତାକା ଦିବସ (ପାଳନ)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5131_159863_485048"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of detecting and splitting video content into separate clips. Clips are created by Windows Movie Maker when there is a significant change from one frame to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="159863">clip creation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485048">କ୍ଲିପ୍ ସୃଷ୍ଟି</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51323_2892217_2893131"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To prevent a UI element such as an error, notification, button, or a visual feature such as line numbers or page margins, from appearing to the end user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2892217">suppress</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893131">ଦବେଇ ଦେବା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51330_2893119_2893127"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Implies that the artifact (object or activity) or some of its characteristics deviate from what is considered ‘normal’; typically a statistical outlier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893119">anomalous</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893127">ଅସଙ୍ଗତ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51331_2893120_2893129"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number calculated to let the customer know how vulnerable devices in their organization are.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893120">exposure score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893129">ଏକ୍ସପୋଜର୍ ସ୍କୋର୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51338_2893964_2893982"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft 365 Teams background effect that is limited only to uploading the user's own images.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893964">custom background</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893982">କଷ୍ଟମ୍ ପୃଷ୍ଠଭୂମି</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51339_2893965_2893981"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live matchmaking service that groups players based on user information and the request for any users who want to play together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893965">SmartMatch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2893981">SmartMatch</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51341_2894028_2894116"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">​The next iteration of the Authenticator app in which users can save and automatically fill passwords, addresses, and payment info on mobile devices and computers (via browser extension).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894028">Microsoft Autofill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894116">Microsoft ଅଟୋଫିଲ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51343_2894031_2894115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of the Windows Clock app that allows the user to set a timer for a period of focus time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894031">Focus sessions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894115">ଫୋକସ୍ ସେସନ୍ସ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51347_2894037_2894117"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The possibility for a person to input text in Windows with their voice (aka dictation).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894037">voice typing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894117">ଭଏସ୍ ଟାଇପିଂ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51349_2894217_2894533"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The international holiday celebrated on March 8 that honors women and is commemorated in various ways around the world, including as a public holiday, a day of protest, or as a celebration of womanhood.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894217">International Women's Day</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894533">ଆନ୍ତର୍ଜାତୀୟ ମହିଳା ଦିବସ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51350_2894218_2894534"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Vietnamese public holiday celebrated on April 30 to commemorate the day in 1975 when North Vietnamese and Việt Cộng forces captured Saigon (now Ho Chi Minh City), signaling the end of the Vietnam War and the beginning of the reunification process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894218">Reunification Day</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894534">ଏକକୀକରଣ ଦିବସ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51351_2894219_2894535"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The day on which the Vietnamese holiday Reunification Day is celebrated if the official holiday itself falls on a weekend.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894219">Reunification Day (Observed)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894535">ଏକକୀକରଣ ଦିବସ (ପାଳିତ)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51352_2894246_2895199"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account from a social identity provider, such as Facebook or Google.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894246">social account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2895199">ସୋସିଆଲ୍ ଏକାଉଣ୍ଟ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51364_2894612_3024974"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The transport layer network protocol based on User Datagram Protocol (UDP), which can improve the performance of web applications that currently use TCP.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2894612">QUIC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><nti