rtualization to create and isolate a secure region of memory from the normal operating system which can be used to host security solutions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929518">VBS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929588">ଭର୍ଚ୍ୟୁଆଲାଇଜେସନ୍-ଆଧାରିତ ସୁରକ୍ଷା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52010_2929644_2929787"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To respond to an invitation and indicate whether or not you plan to attend the event that the invitation is for.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929644">RSVP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929787">ପ୍ରତ୍ୟୁତ୍ତର କରନ୍ତୁ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5202_335537_1881310"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A virtual folder that displays items based on specified search criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="335537">search folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881310">ସନ୍ଧାନ ଫୋଲ୍ଡର୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGende