691_2931750"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The capability of Windows to adapt the way your colors render based on the type of content you consume and/or the environment you are in (dark vs bright, or an environment of a specific color - e.g. a coffee shop with green walls or a theatre with a predominance of red).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2931691">adaptive color</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2931750">ଆଡପ୍ଟିଭ୍ ରଙ୍ଗ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52069_2932124_2934548"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The 2021 version of Microsoft Office Project Standard that utilizes the LTSC servicing model.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2932124">Microsoft Office LTSC Project Standard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2934548">Microsoft Office LTSC Project ଷ୍ଟାଣ୍ଡାର୍ଡ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52069_2932124_2934551"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The 2021 version of Microsoft Office Project Standard that utilizes the LTSC servicing model.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2932124">Microsoft Office LTSC Project Standard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperN