, trusted, and auditable remote assistance for work related apps and endpoints to workers on the frontline and/or in hybrid work environments.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3160523">Microsoft Remote Help</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161112">Microsoft ରିମୋଟ ସହାୟତା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53045_3014886_3015081"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A diagram that illustrates how different entities (such as customers and products) relate to each other in a database.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014886">entity relationship diagram</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3015081">ଏଣ୍ଟ୍ରୀ ସମ୍ପର୍କ ଡାଇଗ୍ରାମ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53046_3014888_3015112"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A diagram for creating medium-fidelity mock-ups of software applications and websites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014888">wireframe diagram</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3015112">ୱେୟାରଫ୍ରେମ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53046_3014888_3015115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A diagram for creating medium-fidelity mock-ups of software applications and websites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014888">wireframe diagram</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3015115">ୱେୟାରଫ୍ରେମ୍ ଡାଇଗ୍ରାମ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53046_3014889_3015112"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A diagram for creating medium-fidelity mock-ups of software applications and websites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014889">wireframe</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3015112">ୱେୟାରଫ୍ରେମ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53046_3014889_3015115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A diagram for creating medium-fidelity mock-ups of software applications and websites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014889">wireframe</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></ter