33679">ପ୍ଲାଟିନମ୍ ଜୁବୁଲି ବ୍ୟାଙ୍କ ଛୁଟି</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5325_145206_1259919"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To minimize the duplication of information in a relational database through effective table design.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="145206">normalize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259919">ସ୍ୱାଭାବିକ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53251_3033532_3033675"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Canadian holiday (colloquially known as Orange Shirt Day) celebrated on September 30 to recognize the legacy of the Canadian Indian residential school system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033532">National Day for Truth and Reconciliation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033675">ସତ୍ୟ ଏବଂ ପୁନଃନିର୍ମାଣ ପାଇଁ ଜାତୀୟ ଦିବସ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53252_3033536_3033663"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The US federal holiday celebrated