Selected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119415">ଇଣ୍ଟିଗ୍ରେସନ୍ ଟେକ୍ସ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55033_3119445_3119501"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of storage architecture that uses a data lake to hold all relevant data for an organization, rather than a data warehouse or other relational database.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119445">lake-first</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119501">ଲେକ୍-ଫାଷ୍ଟ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55034_3119531_3119887"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A capability that enables administrators to secure specific tables or columns from specific report viewers who do not have appropriate access levels.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119531">object-level security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119887">ଅବଜେକ୍ଟ-ଲେଭେଲ୍ ସୁରକ୍ଷା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55035_3119825_3119973"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The practice of structuring information models and associated data schemas such that every data element is mastered (or edited) in only one place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119825">single source of truth</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119973">ସିଙ୍ଗେଲ୍ ସୋର୍ସ ଅଫ୍ ଟ୍ରୁଥ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55036_3119828_3120058"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The enterprise-grade data lake as a service provided within each tenant of Microsoft Fabric.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119828">OneLake</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3120058">ୱାନଲେକ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55037_3119830_3120143"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Fabric, the virtualized copy of data in the lake that all analytical engines can access.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119830">One Copy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3120143">ୱାନ୍ କପି</term><term