>NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6474_329880_485815"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technology allowing users to inject faults into an executable without requiring rebuilding the binary or modifying the source code; thus, providing a means of simulating errors and testing recovery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="329880">fault injection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485815">ଭୁଲ୍ ଇନଞ୍ଜେକ୍ସନ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6475_307228_485572"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The heading for the last Mail Merge step, which allows the user to select how the merged publication or letters are produced.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307228">Complete the merge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485572">ମିଳନ ସଂପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ କରନ୍ତୁ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6477_413711_1881320"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A recording that is attached to your document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="413711">voice comment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="gramm