the recordset properties set by an application. ADO recordsets are mapped to OLE DB rowsets.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="360150">recordset</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485943">ରେକର୍ଡ଼ସେଟ୍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8095_117241_1881111"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To send something in for consideration.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="117241">submit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881111">ଉପସ୍ଥାପନା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8099_265320_1881304"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A folder where a collection of PowerPoint slides is shared.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="265320">Slide Library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1881304">ସ୍ଲାଇଡ୍ ଲାଇବ୍ରେରୀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8102_42162_1426165"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A short horizontal line used as a punctuation mark.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="42162">dash</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1426165">dash</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8115_66527_1259086"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A domain controller that holds the infrastructure operations master role in Active Directory. The infrastructure master updates the group-to-user reference whenever group memberships change and replicates these changes across the domain. At any time, the infrastructure master role can be assigned to only one domain controller in each domain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="66527">infrastructure master</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259086">ସଂସ୍ଥାନ ପ୍ରମୁଖ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8120_375742_1957521"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of features that provides a programming interface for accessing Microsoft Exchange data through the Client Access server role by using Web services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="375742">Exchange Web Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1957521">Exchange ୱେବ୍ ସେବାସମୂହ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8123_234529_485262"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A graphic that indicates follow-up action is required, or otherwise identifies an important item.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234529">flag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="485262">ପତାକା</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8125_359995_1259991"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that uses a minimum amount of data to display the general layout of a report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="359995">Layout Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="or-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1259991">ଲେ ଆଉଟ୍ ପୂର୍ବାଲୋକନ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8136_396927_1802575"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A World Wide Web Consortium specification that describes the structure of dynamic HTML and XML do